Dear Hub71 Team,

My name is Narges Farahani from Parsa International Group, an Istanbul-based =
company developing AI software for the energy sector and healthcare. We are p=
reparing an application to the Hub71 Access Programme and would appreciate gu=
idance before we apply.

Our main products are:
- AI monitoring, predictive maintenance and digital twins for oil and gas ope=
rations, gas turbines and process plants;
- Energy and carbon management with real-time optimisation;
- Healthcare AI: automated analytics for diagnostic-kit data and multimodal e=
arly-risk assessment for neurodegenerative diseases.

The products are advanced prototypes (TRL 4-5). Abu Dhabi is our preferred ba=
se for the Gulf because of its energy and healthcare ecosystem, and we would =
like to run our first pilots there.

Could you advise which cohort and track would fit a company at our stage, and=
 whether an introduction to Hub71's energy or healthcare partners is possible=
 during the programme?

Thank you for your time.

Best regards,

Narges Farahani
AI Sector
Parsa International Group
Istanbul, T=C3=BCrkiye
